SDL-E1044 (spec/table.md)

  x clause does not apply to this table kind: `enforced;` is not part of the normal table vocabulary — it belongs to a relation table
   ,----
 1 | table users { enforced; schemafull; };
   :              ^^^^|^^^
   :                  `-- not this table kind's clause
   `----
